    "docs": [
      {
        "name": "scope.md",
        "rel": "scope.md",
        "mtimeMs": 1787700917474,
        "content": "# Scope\n\n**Bug:** the post-login redirect always lands on `/dashboard`, dropping the\noriginally requested deep link (e.g. `/reports/q3`).\n\n- Reproduced on staging: sign out, hit a deep link, sign back in\n- No `return_to` is captured anywhere in the auth flow today\n- Fix is contained to the auth callback + one session field\n\nSee the [auth flow diagram](https://example.com/auth-flow) for context."
      },
      {
        "name": "plan.md",
        "rel": "plan.md",
        "mtimeMs": 1787704517474,
        "content": "# Plan\n\n1. Capture the requested URL into `session.returnTo` before the auth redirect\n2. On the callback, read `session.returnTo` and redirect there instead of `/dashboard`\n3. Fall back to `/dashboard` when `returnTo` is absent or unsafe\n\nTouches `lib/auth/callback.js` only. Use `new URL(returnTo, origin)` to reject\nabsolute off-site targets before redirecting."
      },
      {
        "name": "proof-of-work.md",
        "rel": "proof-of-work.md",
        "mtimeMs": 1787716997474,
        "content": "# Proof of work\n\n**Result: all green.**\n\n- `session.returnTo` is set in `startAuth()` and read in `handleCallback()`\n- Off-site targets are rejected with `new URL(returnTo, origin).origin === origin`\n- 3 new tests cover: deep link honored, no return-to falls back, off-site target rejected\n\n```js\nconst target = safeReturnTo(session.returnTo, req.headers.origin);\nres.redirect(target ?? '/dashboard');\n```\n\nFull suite: `142 passed, 0 failed`. See [PR #142](https://github.com/acme/finance-app/pull/142)\nfor the diff."
      },
      {
        "name": "reports/qa.md",
        "rel": "reports/qa.md",
        "mtimeMs": 1787716997474,
        "content": "# QA report\n\nRan full suite plus the 3 new regression tests. All green, no flakes across\n3 runs."
      }
    ],
